        "location": "engine/runtime/opencode_json_write.go:55-58",
        "claim": "An install over an existing bare-name entry from an earlier install skips the server because it is present, so it never upgrades it to the absolute path. Users who already installed keep the launcher-PATH failure this commit sets out to fix, and the install message does not mention it. Because owns() now treats both forms as current, Status also reports supported for the bare entry, so the problem is invisible.",
