        ]
      }
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Diff-only review. The write loop continues when serversOf(root)[server.name] is present and never compares the existing form against the resolved one.",
      "The new test TestOpenCodeOwnsOurEntryInEitherFormAndNothingElse asserts the bare entry is kept after Install, which confirms the behavior is intended but leaves existing installs unfixed."
